# Lever: after half a second, raises the typed event Pulled(force, by) on the object named "Door".
# Part of the custom events example: custom_events_door.okayvs handles it, custom_events_light.okayvs
# listens to the Door's dispatcher. Put the three graphs on objects named Lever, Door and Light.
event Pulled(Number force, Text by)

node 1 OnStart
entry OnStart 1
node 2 Delay 0.5
node 3 RaiseEvent Pulled
default 3 0 "Door"
default 3 1 3
default 3 2 "the Lever"
exec 1 0 2
exec 2 0 3
